---
/**
 * Plugin lifecycle from authoring to runtime and later evolution.
 */
---

<figure class="fc-diagram">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 920 900"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="fc-plugin-life-title fc-plugin-life-desc"
  >
    <title id="fc-plugin-life-title">Fastcart plugin lifecycle</title>
    <desc id="fc-plugin-life-desc">
      Authors scaffold a plugin, implement handlers and UI, pack a deterministic
      archive, upload it, and the host validates and stores it as a disabled
      installation. Enabling validates settings. The first request lazily starts
      the workerd host, which compiles the artifact by digest and invokes a
      handler. Upgrades record the previous digest, rollback swaps them, and
      removal requires the plugin to be disabled.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="fc-plugin-life-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="9"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto-start-reverse"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="fc-arrow"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect class="fc-step-brand" x="250" y="20" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="42" text-anchor="middle">fastcart-plugin init</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="60" text-anchor="middle">minimal · admin · chat template</text>

    <rect class="fc-step" x="250" y="96" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="118" text-anchor="middle">Implement handlers and surfaces</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="136" text-anchor="middle">fetch · admin · events · jobs · UI assets</text>

    <rect class="fc-step" x="250" y="172" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="194" text-anchor="middle">pack</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="212" text-anchor="middle">deterministic tar.gz + SHA-256 digest</text>

    <rect class="fc-step" x="250" y="248" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="270" text-anchor="middle">Upload via Admin → Plugins</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="288" text-anchor="middle">multipart archive; 20 MB cap</text>

    <rect class="fc-step" x="250" y="324" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="346" text-anchor="middle">Validate manifest, archive and targets</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="364" text-anchor="middle">scopes · paths · digests · settings schema</text>

    <rect class="fc-step" x="250" y="400" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="422" text-anchor="middle">Store artifact and installation row</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="440" text-anchor="middle">content-addressed; disabled by default</text>

    <rect class="fc-step" x="250" y="476" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="498" text-anchor="middle">Enable</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="516" text-anchor="middle">validate settings against the JSON Schema</text>

    <rect class="fc-step" x="250" y="552" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="574" text-anchor="middle">First request starts the plugin host</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="592" text-anchor="middle">lazy workerd start · /__fastcart/health</text>

    <rect class="fc-step" x="250" y="628" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="650" text-anchor="middle">Loader compiles id@digest</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="668" text-anchor="middle">bundle JSON fetched with the runtime token</text>

    <rect class="fc-step" x="250" y="704" width="400" height="52" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="726" text-anchor="middle">Invoke a handler</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="744" text-anchor="middle">fetch · admin · events · jobs</text>

    <rect class="fc-step-brand" x="250" y="780" width="400" height="68" rx="9"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="450" y="804" text-anchor="middle">Evolve</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="823" text-anchor="middle">upgrade → new digest · rollback → previous</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="450" y="840" text-anchor="middle">disable stops routing · remove requires disabled</text>

    <!-- Main flow -->
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 72 V 94" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 148 V 170" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 224 V 246" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 300 V 322" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 376 V 398" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 452 V 474" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 528 V 550" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 604 V 626" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 680 V 702" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 450 756 V 778" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Reject branch -->
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 650 350 H 698" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="674" y="342" text-anchor="middle">invalid</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="700" y="324" width="190" height="52" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="714" y="346">400 · rejected</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="714" y="364">no row, no artifact written</text>

    <!-- Runtime disabled branch -->
    <path class="fc-line" d="M 650 502 H 698" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="674" y="494" text-anchor="middle">disabled</text>
    <rect class="fc-box" x="700" y="476" width="190" height="52" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="714" y="498">409 · runtime off</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="714" y="516">plugins.enabled = false</text>

    <!-- Evolution notes -->
    <rect class="fc-box" x="700" y="760" width="190" height="108" rx="8"></rect>
    <text class="fc-label-strong" x="714" y="782">Upgrade rules</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="714" y="800">new scope needs consent</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="714" y="817">previous_digest kept</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="714" y="834">rollback swaps digests</text>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="714" y="851">artifacts GC by reference</text>

    <!-- Upgrade loop -->
    <path class="fc-line-dashed" d="M 250 814 H 230 V 426 H 248" marker-end="url(#fc-plugin-life-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="fc-sub" x="222" y="620" transform="rotate(-90 222 620)" text-anchor="middle">new artifact</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>Figure 4.</strong> Install, enable, upgrade, rollback and disable are
    database state changes. No configuration is regenerated and the plugin host
    is not restarted: the next request resolves the new digest and the loader
    compiles it lazily.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
